title: Analytics › Denial outcomes and dismissed recommendations
route: /analytics
intro: What other screens write back to Analytics. Two figures sit under the denial table (in its folded section) and move when a denial is accepted or an appeal is ruled on. The 'Denial rate' tile shows the accepted count too. A list of dismissal reasons appears once a recommendation has been dismissed, inside the folded section 'How FLO's advice and drafts perform'. Each event moves the numbers only a little.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: the starting figures (96 rulings, 56% overturned, 17 accepted denials) are invented. Everything recorded in the demo counts in 'This quarter' and 'Last 12 months', never in 'Last quarter', and follows the payer and program menus. Accepting a denial also moves Workload (one more handled, one fewer open).
---
start s1 "Look at the 'Denial rate' tile, then open 'Common denial reasons by payer' and scroll to its foot"
screen sc "Tile 'Denial rate': '311 denials · 17 accepted'\nTwo figures under the table\n'Appeals overturned'  56%, '54 of 96 rulings this quarter'\n'Denials accepted'  17, 'denials this quarter'"

group gApp "Appeals overturned"
  ext x1 "The payer rules on an appeal\n(demo: the person logs the ruling)"
  store st1 "Denial Intelligence records the ruling\nOverturned, partly restored or upheld"
  process p1 "Rulings go up by one\nOverturned and partly restored also add to 'overturned'\nUpheld only adds to the rulings"
  decision q1 "Fewer than 20 rulings in this view?"
  screen o1 "For example 57%, '55 of 97 rulings this quarter'"
  screen o2 "'-' and 'Not enough decisions yet'\nA single payer with few rulings, for example Lakeshore"
endgroup

group gOff "Denials accepted"
  click k1 "In Denial Intelligence the person accepts a denial"
  store st2 "Denial Intelligence records the accepted denial\nWith its payer"
  process p2 "The count goes up by one\nFor example 17 becomes 18, and the payer and program menus count it for that payer and program"
  screen o3 "'18', 'denials this quarter' under the table\nThe tile reads '311 denials · 18 accepted'\nWorkload: '9 handled', '31 still open'"
endgroup

group gDis "Why recommendations were dismissed"
  click k2 "On a case, the person dismisses a recommendation and gives a reason"
  store st3 "Authorizations records the reason\nWith the request, so Analytics can find its payer"
  decision q2 "Any dismissal in this view?"
  screen d1 "In the folded section 'How FLO's advice and drafts perform'\n'Why recommendations were dismissed'\n'The reason given each time someone dismissed a recommendation, this quarter.'\nOne row per reason, biggest first, '2 times' or '1 time'\nThe section's summary adds '2 recommendations dismissed.'"
  screen d2 "No list at all\nNothing was dismissed, or the period is 'Last quarter', or the payer or program has none"
endgroup

process m1 "The monthly report and its printout carry the same figures\n'Denial outcomes' always, 'Why recommendations were dismissed' when the list shows"
process m2 "Pick another period, payer or program\nThe figures are worked out again from the recorded events"
goto g1 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Written appeal › Record the payer's decision"
goto g2 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Accept the denial"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Recommended actions › Dismiss and bring back"
goto g4 "Continues in: Analytics › Monthly report › What the files contain"
end e1 "Page matches what was recorded"

s1 --> sc
sc -.-> g1 & g2 & g3
x1 --> st1 --> p1 --> q1
q1 -->|No| o1 --> e1
q1 -->|Yes| o2 --> e1
k1 --> st2 --> p2 --> o3 --> e1
k2 --> st3 --> q2
q2 -->|Yes| d1 --> e1
q2 -->|No| d2 --> e1
sc --> x1 & k1 & k2
e1 -.-> m1 --> g4
e1 -.-> m2
